      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KINGSBRAE BRETT (1) is a talented type and proved too classy last time to win by 0.8 lengths at this track in a handy 29.74 beating Rosa Marie. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Hard to fault recent form and looks a key chance again. UNLEASH IN MIAMI (7) has a strong record this track and trip with eight wins and six placings from 21 starts. Was out of the placings last time (30.40) at this track in a Mix 1/2/3, finishing fourth and beaten 7 lengths. Looks well placed here and among the chances. KOORINGA TRISH (2) was out of the placings last time when fifth at Q Parklands (30.38) but scored three back at Taree Super Track (30.17). Safe beginner who has drawn to advantage. Key player if finds best. KISAUNI (3) is building a nice sequence of wins and will be in the mix again.",
